#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:160
#: 45875533525041dcbbb50b2210c40cf3
msgid "`Lattice Strain` → `Atomic Perturb`：先做全局形变，再补局部位移"
msgstr ""
"`Lattice Strain` → `Atomic Perturb`: apply a global deformation, then add "
"local displacements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:161
#: 1c00d615cd51404881f0e6352d072807
msgid "`Shear Matrix Strain` → `Atomic Perturb`：剪切变形后加坐标噪声"
msgstr ""
"`Shear Matrix Strain` -> `Atomic Perturb`: add coordinate noise after a "
"shear deformation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:162
#: 05c5e909c9ef45029bd638a5e335e3f6
msgid "`Atomic Perturb` → `FPS Filter`：大批量扰动后去重"
msgstr ""
"`Atomic Perturb` → `FPS Filter`: remove redundancy after large-scale "
"perturbation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:164
#: c34c679510e44344a852af5d1524811c
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:166
#: 6aa94cf191eb43608ad9434cb69495d4
msgid ""
"**扰动后出现异常短键（< 1.0 Å）。** 两个相邻原子随机位移方向恰好相反，距离骤减。降低 `max_distance` 或增大 "
"`max_num` 后通过 `FPS Filter` 筛掉短键结构。这是随机扰动的固有局限——它不做碰撞检测。"
msgstr ""
"**Perturbation creates an abnormally short contact below 1.0 Å.** Two "
"neighboring atoms happened to move toward each other. Reduce `max_distance`,"
" or generate a larger pool and remove invalid structures before "
"representative selection. This card does not perform collision detection, so"
" geometry validation remains necessary."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:168
#: 8014e3f53d3649ed8ef386ac949de94e
msgid "**分子晶体中分子碎掉了。** `identify_organic` 没开。开启后整个分子团簇做刚性平移，分子内键长完全保留。"
msgstr ""
"**Molecules in a molecular crystal are distorted or broken.** Enable "
"`identify_organic` so each molecular cluster is translated rigidly and its "
"internal bond lengths are preserved."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:170
#: 7189a0c603e144089c1de9437463c5de
msgid ""
"**扰动后力 MAE 没改善。** 可能 `max_distance` 太小，位移落在模型已经学好的线性区内。增大到 0.3~0.5 Å "
"试试。也可能体系本身的势能面非谐性很强，随机扰动方向不一定是最需要的——此时用 `Vib Mode Perturb` 替代，沿真实振动模方向做位移。"
msgstr ""
"**Force MAE does not improve after adding perturbed data.** `max_distance` "
"may be too small, leaving samples inside an already learned linear region; "
"test 0.3–0.5 Å while validating geometry. If the potential-energy surface is"
" strongly anharmonic, arbitrary directions may be inefficient. Use `Vib Mode"
" Perturb` to displace along physically meaningful vibrational modes instead."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:172
#: 36f73b62505a40d6999a07d225de7b3d
msgid ""
"**Sobol 引擎 output 和预期不一致。** Sobol 序列的 scramble 受 seed 控制。如果 "
"`use_seed=false`，不同运行的 Sobol 序列也不同。需要可复现时必须 `use_seed=true`。"
msgstr ""
"**Sobol output differs between runs.** The Sobol scramble depends on the "
"seed. When `use_seed=false`, repeated runs may therefore use different "
"sequences. Set `use_seed=true` for reproducible output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:174
msgid ""
"**Sobol 提示原子数超过 7,067。** 每个原子需要三个 Sobol 维度，已超过 SciPy "
"支持的最大维数。改用默认的 Uniform；这不会改变每个原子的位移上限，只会改变随机点的抽样顺序。"
msgstr ""
"**Sobol reports more than 7,067 atoms.** Each atom consumes three Sobol "
"dimensions, so the input exceeds SciPy's maximum dimensionality. Use the "
"default Uniform engine. This keeps each atom's displacement limit unchanged "
"and only changes how random points are sampled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:174
#: 8ea418ab1db44126b6b5f0207ccb3a61
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:176
#: c66472588c4743f2bc94382ebff6b552
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`Pert(d={max_distance},{U|S})` —— `U` 表示 Uniform，`S` 表示 Sobol。"
msgstr "`Pert(d={max_distance},{U|S})`, where `U` means Uniform and `S` means Sobol."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:178
#: f419a29516104d08be8f90d2961a55ba
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/perturb-card.md:180
#: 7b27ce7fbaea48b6bb17911361546426
msgid ""
"勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → "
"相同输入可复现；几何不同的输入帧使用不同但稳定的派生随机流。"
msgstr ""
"Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce the same input; geometrically "
"different frames use distinct but stable derived random streams."
